    Topic "All right, I'll swing by" goto close

On offer
    Say "If you succeed in this hunt I'll give you boots as reward. Apostle are nomad monks of the Esoteric Buddhist order and turn into savage mages of darkness come nightfall."
    Topic "Tell me more..." do
